# Ignore everything by default
/*

# Track only specific project folders
!/Assets/
Assets/*
!Assets/#User/
Assets/#User/*
!Assets/#User/GrowAGarden/
!Assets/#User/GrowAGarden/**

# Our scripts live inside Community Modules; the rest of CM is template-supplied
!Assets/#User/Community Modules/
Assets/#User/Community Modules/*
!Assets/#User/Community Modules/Scripts/
Assets/#User/Community Modules/Scripts/*
!Assets/#User/Community Modules/Scripts/GrowAGarden/
!Assets/#User/Community Modules/Scripts/GrowAGarden/**
!Assets/#User/Community Modules/Scripts/GrowAGarden.meta
!Assets/#User/Community Modules/Scripts/Vulps.GrowAGarden.asmdef
!Assets/#User/Community Modules/Scripts/Vulps.GrowAGarden.asmdef.meta
# One CM file we have edited in place: ARSVideoPlayer finds its AudioSource from video events (docs/light-show.md)
!Assets/#User/Community Modules/Scripts/ARS Plugin/
Assets/#User/Community Modules/Scripts/ARS Plugin/*
!Assets/#User/Community Modules/Scripts/ARS Plugin/VideoPlayer/
Assets/#User/Community Modules/Scripts/ARS Plugin/VideoPlayer/*
!Assets/#User/Community Modules/Scripts/ARS Plugin/VideoPlayer/ARSVideoPlayer.cs
!Assets/#User/Community Modules/Scripts/ARS Plugin/VideoPlayer/ARSVideoPlayer.cs.meta

# Track git and documentation files
!/.gitignore
!/.gitattributes
!/README.md
!/CLAUDE.md

# Narration sources — Audacity projects behind sounds/*.mp3
!/Audacity/
!/Audacity/**

# Design docs — outside Assets/, so Unity never imports them
!/docs/
!/docs/**

# Ad-hoc screenshots dropped in the repo root for review
/screenshot.png

# Obsidian per-user layout
/docs/.obsidian/workspace*.json
